#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:149
msgid "View ALL Projects"
msgstr "檢視所有專案"

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:150
msgid "Allows users to view ALL Projects, regardless of Project sharing and visibility settings."
msgstr "允許使用者檢視所有專案，不受專案的分享與可見性設定限制。"

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:168
msgid "Comment on ALL Projects"
msgstr "在所有專案中留言"

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:169
msgid ""
"Allows users to comment on ALL Projects, regardless of Project sharing and visibility settings.\n"
"\n"
"This permission also requires the **View ALL Projects** permission."
msgstr ""
"允許使用者在所有專案中留言，不受專案的分享與可見性設定限制。\n"
"\n"
"此權限也需要**檢視所有專案**權限。"

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:187
msgid "Edit ALL Projects"
msgstr "編輯所有專案"

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:188
msgid ""
"Allows users to edit ALL Projects, regardless of Project sharing and visibility settings.\n"
"\n"
"This permission also requires the **View ALL Projects** and **Comment on ALL Projects** permissions."
msgstr ""
"允許使用者編輯所有專案，不受專案的分享與可見性設定限制。\n"
"\n"
"此權限也需要**檢視所有專案**及**在所有專案中留言**權限。"

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:206
msgid "Manage ALL Projects"
msgstr "管理所有專案"

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:207
msgid ""
"Allows users to manage ALL Projects as if they were owners, regardless of Project sharing and visibility settings.\n"
"\n"
"This permission also requires the **View ALL Projects**, **Comment on ALL Projects**, and **Edit ALL Projects** permissions."
msgstr ""
"允許使用者以擁有者的權限管理所有專案，不受專案的分享與可見性設定限制。\n"
"\n"
"此權限也需要**檢視所有專案**、**在所有專案中留言**及**編輯所有專案**權限。"

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:225
msgid "Manage Project Templates"
msgstr "管理專案模板"

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:226
msgid ""
"Allows users to set Projects as Project templates.\n"
"\n"
"Users with this permission can also create new Projects directly from Knowledge Models, even when project creation is restricted to templates."
msgstr ""
"允許使用者將專案設為專案模板。\n"
"\n"
"即使已設定只能從模板建立專案，擁有此權限的使用者仍可直接從知識模型建立新專案。"

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:244
